      "question": "<a href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/remove-duplicates-from-sorted-list-ii\" target=\"_blank\">82. Remove Duplicates from Sorted List II</a>",
      "number": 1,
      "hint": null,
      "notes": "",
      "explanation": "Use a sentinel head and a predecessor pointer. Iterate through the list; if a duplicate sequence is found, skip all duplicates by advancing the current pointer until a unique element or the end of the list is reached. Connect the predecessor to this unique element.\nTime complexity: O(n), Space complexity: O(1)\nAlgorithms: Linked List Traversal, Two Pointers\nData Structures: Linked List\nKey concepts: Sentinel node, Duplicate removal, Pointer manipulation",
