      "algo": 5,
      "deck": "Leetcode program med free 2",
      "question": "<a href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/gray-code\" target=\"_blank\">89. Gray Code</a>",
      "number": 3,
      "hint": null,
      "notes": "",
      "explanation": "Generate Gray codes iteratively or using the formula G(i) = i XOR (i &gt;&gt; 1). For an iterative approach, start with [0]. To get G(n) from G(n-1), append G(n-1) reversed with 2^(n-1) added to each element.\nTime complexity: O(2^n), Space complexity: O(2^n) to store the result\nAlgorithms: Bit Manipulation, Iterative sequence generation\nData Structures: List\nKey concepts: Reflective binary code, Bitwise XOR, Pattern recognition",
