      "algo": 5,
      "deck": "Leetcode program med free 2",
      "question": "<a href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/unique-binary-search-trees-ii\" target=\"_blank\">95. Unique Binary Search Trees II</a>",
      "number": 8,
      "hint": null,
      "notes": "",
      "explanation": "Use a recursive approach with memoization (or dynamic programming). For a range [start, end], iterate through each number i in this range as the root. Recursively generate all unique left subtrees from [start, i-1] and all unique right subtrees from [i+1, end]. Combine each left subtree with each right subtree for root i.\nTime complexity: O(N * Gn) where Gn is the nth Catalan number. Space complexity: O(N * Gn) for storing trees and recursion.\nAlgorithms: Recursion, Dynamic Programming (conceptually), Tree Construction\nData Structures: Binary Tree, List\nKey concepts: BST properties, Divide and conquer, Combinatorial tree generation",
      "answers": [
        {
          "id": 133011,
