    {
      "type": "card",
      "algo": 5,
      "deck": "Leetcode program med free 2",
      "question": "<a href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/interleaving-string\" target=\"_blank\">97. Interleaving String</a>",
      "number": 10,
      "hint": null,
      "notes": "",
      "explanation": "Use 2D dynamic programming. dp[i][j] is true if s3[0...i+j-1] can be formed by interleaving s1[0...i-1] and s2[0...j-1]. If s1[i-1] == s3[i+j-1], dp[i][j] can be true if dp[i-1][j] is true. If s2[j-1] == s3[i+j-1], dp[i][j] can be true if dp[i][j-1] is true.\nTime complexity: O(m*n), Space complexity: O(m*n) or O(min(m,n)) with space optimization\nAlgorithms: Dynamic Programming\nData Structures: 2D Boolean Array (DP table)\nKey concepts: String matching, DP state transition, Interleaving conditions",
